{"version":1,"content":"<p>【試試 😆】對於機械鍵盤玩家而言，挑選合適的軸體向來是一大考驗。</p><p>除了手感要好之外，按鍵聲音亦成為了其中一大關鍵。</p><p>近日，網絡上出現了一個名為「Switch Lab」的軸體聲音資料庫，平台整合了 Cherry、Gateron、Outemu、TTC 及 Leobog 等主流品牌的超過 100 款鍵盤軸體音效，讓使用者在購買前能夠於線上試聽打字聲響。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T11:21:44.876408+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:15:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T19:37:54.688077+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:17:40.428315+00:00","content_hash":"05bf79d995812307bccc93dce491885ca1d4f892a5f8bb90c05af06bdf967c7d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}